ith empty ValidationMessage set because array length (3) is between minItems=2 and maxItems=5.', 'description': 'The schema restricts array length to a minimum of 2 and a maximum of 5. The supplied array satisfies both constraints.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '[1]'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult containing a ValidationMessage indicating that the array has fewer items than the required minItems of 2.', 'description': 'Array length is below the allowed minimum, resulting in a validation error.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '[1,2,3,4,5,6]'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult containing a ValidationMessage indicating that the array exceeds the maxItems limit of 5.', 'description': 'Array length exceeds the defined maximum, causing a validation error.'}]}, {'group': 'AdditionalProperties False', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '{"allowed": "yes"}'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult with empty ValidationMessage set because the object contains only the defined property "allowed".', 'description': 'The schema defines a property "allowed" and sets "additionalProperties": false. The instance complies.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '{"allowed": "yes", "extra": 123}'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult containing a ValidationMessage stating that property "extra" is not allowed (additionalProperties = false).', 'description': 'The instance contains an extra property not defined in the schema, which should be rejected.'}]}, {'group': 'Format Validation (date-time)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '"2023-08-15T13:45:30Z"'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult with empty ValidationMessage set because the string conforms to the "date-time" format.', 'description': 'The schema specifies "format": "date-time". The supplied ISO‑8601 string is valid.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '"15-08-2023 13:45"'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult containing a ValidationMessage indicating that the value does not match the "date-time" format.', 'description': 'The string does not follow the required date‑time format, leading to a format validation error.'}]}, {'group': 'Multiple Validators Combined (type + minLength + pattern)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '"AB12"'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult with empty ValidationMessage set because the string is of type string, meets minLength=4, and matches pattern "^[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}$".', 'description': 'The schema applies three validators simultaneously. The instance satisfies all, resulting in no errors.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '"A12"'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult containing two ValidationMessages: one for minLength violation (length 3 < 4) and one for pattern mismatch.', 'description': 'The instance fails both the minimum length and pattern validators, so both errors should be reported.'}]}, {'group': 'Keyword Walk Listener Runner Null (No Invocation)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '{"simple": true}'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult with empty ValidationMessage set and no interaction with WalkListenerRunner (i.e., no NPE, listener not called).', 'description': 'When keywordWalkListenerRunner is null, validateAndCollect should execute normally without attempting to invoke a listener.'}]}, {'group': '$id Base URI Handling', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '{"ref": {"$ref": "other-schema.json#/defs/value"}}'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult with empty ValidationMessage set because the $id of the current schema resolves the relative reference correctly.', 'description': 'The schema defines an "$id": "http://example.com/schemas/". The instance uses a relative $ref. Validation should resolve the reference using the base URI derived from $id and succeed.'}]}, {'group': 'ExecutionContext Customizer Adding Custom Format Validator', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'node', 'value': '"CUSTOM-123"'}], 'expected': 'ValidationResult containing a ValidationMessage produced by the custom format validator (e.g., "custom-format" error) while other validators pass.', 'description': 'A custom ExecutionContext adds a validator for a made‑up format "custom-format". The instance does not satisfy this format, so the custom validator should contribute an error to the result.'}]}]
